Portability: small MSVC / Windows fixes across shared code

Name resolution, large configuration receive, rand(), DLL modules,
ODBC, WMI, vault and VMware counters; on 8.0 also the per-component log
level (Unix-only upstream) and a macro parameter named __out, which is an
SAL annotation in the MSVC headers.

